# `db init`/`db update` write here: which migration hash *this* local
# Postgres currently sits at. Per-environment state, not portable history —
# the migration packages themselves (migrations-postgres/app/<name>/) are
# tracked; this pointer isn't, the same way a migrations table lives in the
# database itself in most other migration tools, not the repo.
migrations-postgres/app/refs/
